#tutor03
                            Military Academy of Kazan
                            2nd of October
Dear % &,

Your superiors appreciated your recent success.
In your new mission you will stay in the region, the Royan
base is threatened by a recent communist settlement, their
base hasn't been located yet.
Your job will be to flush them out and annihilate them.

The ennemy is fully armed, Headquarters has decided to
dispatch an artillery expert for you. Make use of his
knowledge. You will be engaged in a technological race
against your ennemy, it's up to you to be the fastest.

It is the last time I will transmit orders to you,
from now on you will deal with Colonel Kurt Rorscham.
He is used to terrorising newcomers, do not try to coax
him, it will be worse for you.
Follow his advice to the letter and most of all do not
disappoint him, if you fail he will be ruthless.

Good luck to you %.